<span class="paper-label">PAPER 1 · PTH · BMC Endocr Disord 2026</span>

```{=html}
<div class="pth-process-flow" role="img" aria-label="참고집단 선정과 MAD 이상치 제거 후 주 분석과 소표본 보완 분석으로 분기되는 PTH 참고구간 분석 절차">
  <article class="pth-process-card pth-step-1 pth-common-step-1">
    <span class="pth-process-label">STEP 1</span>
    <span class="pth-process-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M7 9h34L29 24v11l-10 5V24L7 9Z"/>
        <circle cx="14" cy="6" r="2.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="6" r="2.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="34" cy="6" r="2.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <h3 class="pth-process-title">참고집단 선정</h3>
    <p class="pth-process-subtitle">Stepwise reference population selection</p>
    <p class="pth-process-desc">질환, 보충제 사용,<br>비만, 당뇨, 신기능, Vitamin D 등<br>PTH 영향 조건을 순서대로 적용</p>
    <div class="pth-process-summary">누구를 참고집단에 넣을지 정함</div>
  </article>

  <div class="pth-process-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <article class="pth-process-card pth-step-2 pth-common-step-2">
    <span class="pth-process-label">STEP 2</span>
    <span class="pth-process-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round">
        <path d="M7 39V9M7 39h34"/><circle cx="15" cy="31" r="2.6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="22" cy="27" r="2.6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="29" cy="23" r="2.6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="38" cy="10" r="3"/><path d="m34 6 8 8m0-8-8 8"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <h3 class="pth-process-title">이상치 제거</h3>
    <p class="pth-process-subtitle">MAD outlier detection</p>
    <p class="pth-process-desc">PTH 분포에서 중앙값을 기준으로<br>너무 멀리 떨어진 값을 제거</p>
    <p class="pth-process-extra">Median absolute deviation (MAD)</p>
    <div class="pth-process-summary">튀는 값을 빼서 상한 왜곡을 줄임</div>
  </article>

  <div class="pth-branch-connector" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 500" preserveAspectRatio="none">
      <defs>
        <marker id="pth-branch-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10Z" fill="#56776c"/>
        </marker>
      </defs>
      <path d="M0 250 H18 C40 250 38 84 88 84" fill="none" stroke="#56776c" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" marker-end="url(#pth-branch-arrow)"/>
      <path d="M18 250 C40 250 38 339 88 339" fill="none" stroke="#8b7358" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" marker-end="url(#pth-branch-arrow)"/>
      <circle cx="18" cy="250" r="7" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#56776c" stroke-width="4"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="pth-branch-lane pth-main-lane">
    <article class="pth-process-card pth-step-3 pth-branch-card">
      <span class="pth-process-label">STEP 3 · MAIN ANALYSIS</span>
      <span class="pth-process-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="14" cy="16" r="5"/><circle cx="29" cy="13" r="4"/><path d="M5 35c1-8 5-12 10-12s9 4 10 12M23 31c1-7 4-11 8-11 5 0 8 4 9 11"/><path d="M34 36h10M39 31v10"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <h3 class="pth-process-title">복합표본 가중 반영</h3>
      <p class="pth-process-subtitle">Complex survey weighting</p>
      <p class="pth-process-desc">층화·집락·검진 가중치를 반영해 40세 이상 한국 성인의<br>2.5th–97.5th percentile 추정</p>
      <div class="pth-process-summary">표본을 40세 이상 한국 성인에 맞춰 반영</div>
    </article>
    <div class="pth-process-result">
      <div><span class="pth-result-label">MAIN RESULT</span><span class="pth-result-main">주요 참고구간<br>20.5–67.7 pg/mL</span></div>
      <p class="pth-result-desc">Step 8 주요 분석집단 · 40세 이상 한국 성인<br>가중 percentile 추정</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pth-branch-lane pth-small-lane">
    <article class="pth-process-card pth-step-4 pth-branch-card">
      <span class="pth-process-label">IF N &lt; 120</span>
      <span class="pth-process-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M8 14h24M8 24h32M8 34h27"/><path d="M13 10v8M27 20v8M20 30v8"/><path d="M35 8a9 9 0 0 1 6 14M41 22l-1-6-5 3"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <h3 class="pth-process-title">소표본 보완 분석</h3>
      <p class="pth-process-subtitle">CLSI robust method + bootstrap</p>
      <p class="pth-process-desc">n&lt;120 하위집단: 이상치 제거 후 비가중 PTH에<br>CLSI EP28-A3c 기반 robust method 적용<span class="pth-bootstrap-note">Bootstrap으로 참고하한·참고상한의 90% CI 추정</span></p>
      <div class="pth-process-summary">작은 표본의 불확실성까지 함께 보고</div>
    </article>
    <div class="pth-process-result warning">
      <div><span class="pth-result-label">SMALL SUBGROUP</span><span class="pth-result-main">Step 9–11은 N&lt;120</span></div>
      <p class="pth-result-desc">소표본 보완 분석을 사용했지만<br>참고한계의 정밀도는 낮음</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

<div class="key-message" markdown="1">**참고집단 선정과 MAD는 공통 전처리이고,** 이후 주 분석은 survey-weighted percentile,<br>n&lt;120 집단은 robust method와 bootstrap으로 보완했다.
</div>
<div class="small-source">Choi R, et al. BMC Endocr Disord. 2026;26:176 · Methods / Table 1–3</div>
